---
import FounderPhoto from "../components/FounderPhoto.astro";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Invitation from "../components/Invitation.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="About Mohsin Khan & the firm"
  description="Meet Mohsin Khan, founder of Moxin Sterling Advisory, and learn about the firm's practical approach to records, reporting and business conversations."
>
  <section class="page-hero container">
    <p class="eyebrow">About the firm</p>
    <h1>
      Useful figures.
      <br />
      Human conversations.
    </h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Accountancy is most useful when you understand what the numbers mean for
      your business.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="section container split">
    <FounderPhoto />
    <div class="prose">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Meet Mohsin Khan.</h2>
      <p>
        Mohsin Khan is the founder of Moxin Sterling Advisory, based in Bangor. His approach centres on organised bookkeeping, clear reporting and helping business owners understand their figures.
      </p>
      <p>
        Moxin Sterling Advisory supports sole traders, contractors, start-ups
        and small limited companies. We begin with the business in front of us:
        how it works, what records it keeps and where support would be useful.
      </p>
      <p>Whether you are choosing your first accountant or looking for a more personal working relationship, the starting point is a clear conversation about what you need.</p>
      <p>
        Our aim is a straightforward working relationship, with clear
        responsibilities and an agreed scope.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section approach">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">How we aim to work</p>
      <div class="commitments">
        <article>
          <h3>Listen first</h3>
          <p>
            Understand your circumstances before discussing a service or quote.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Explain the work</h3>
          <p>
            Set out what is included, what information is needed and what
            happens next.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <h3>Keep it useful</h3>
          <p>
            Focus on records and reporting that help you understand the
            business.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Invitation />
</Layout>
